  "prefLabel": "Tre 208.01 Role of Treasury Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 208.01 Role of Treasury Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings. Unless called as witnesses or acting as presiding officer, treasury staff shall have no role in any enforcement or disciplinary hearing.\n\nSource. #7589-A, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9575-A, eff 10-22-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tre200.html"
